{
  "name": "Stages · Skip and merge (jsonb)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Skip and merge\nThe table is read once. For every stage: rows that already carry its tag take the lower wire, the others go through the sub-workflow, and a **Merge** (Append) joins both before the next stage. So every stage is entered at most once, with exactly the rows that still need it.\n\nThe sub-workflow must return the rows with their new `status`. Replace the Webhook with your own trigger.",
